---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SafetyBanner from '../components/SafetyBanner.astro';
import '../styles/about.css';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="What Bactiverse is, how Copy prompt works, and our educational safety stance."
	hideRail
>
	<article class="about page-enter">
		<header class="about__intro">
			<h1 id="about-heading">About Bactiverse</h1>
			<p class="about__lede">
				Bactiverse is an open gallery of bacteria. Each entry pairs a specimen visual with a
				plain-language science pack you can copy as a prompt into your own study notes or writing
				tools.
			</p>
			<p class="about__cta">
				<a href="/">Browse the gallery</a>
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="about__section" aria-labelledby="what-heading">
			<h2 id="what-heading">What this is</h2>
			<p>
				Browse the catalogue, open an organism, and read what it looks like, where it lives, and
				what it is famous for — in everyday language. Sources are listed on every detail page so you
				can check the grounding yourself.
			</p>
			<p>
				This is a thinking and writing aid, not a textbook replacement and not a lab manual.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="about__section" aria-labelledby="prompt-heading">
			<h2 id="prompt-heading">How Copy prompt works</h2>
			<p>
				On a detail page, <strong>Copy prompt</strong> builds a short text pack from that entry’s
				facts — identity, traits, and study or writing ideas — then puts it on your clipboard.
			</p>
			<ul class="about__list">
				<li>Paste it into your notes or an LLM chat.</li>
				<li>Fill in the blank: <em>I’m using this for: ___</em></li>
				<li>
					Ask for study planning or a plain-language writeup. The prompt tells the model not to
					invent facts and to refuse dangerous lab instructions.
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Nothing leaves your browser when you copy — the text is assembled on the page from the
				entry you already opened.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section id="safety" class="about__section about__safety" aria-labelledby="safety-heading">
			<h2 id="safety-heading">Safety stance</h2>
			<SafetyBanner showAboutLink={false} />
			<p>
				Bactiverse is for education and research writing only. It helps you explore organisms as
				ideas — for essays, study plans, and grounded conversations with AI tools.
			</p>
			<ul class="about__refuse" aria-label="What we do not provide">
				<li>No culturing, isolation, or growth instructions</li>
				<li>No weaponization or dual-use how-tos</li>
				<li>No “grow this at home” or other wet-lab recipes</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="about__closing">
				If you need hands-on microbiology, use a qualified lab, course, or professional setting —
				not this site.
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
